# Testing

## Stack

| Layer | Tool | Location |
|-------|------|----------|
| Unit (FE) | Vitest | `apps/web/**/*.test.tsx` |
| Unit (BE) | Jest/Vitest | `apps/api/**/*.spec.ts` |
| API integration | Supertest | `apps/api/test/` |
| E2E | Playwright | `e2e/` or `apps/web/e2e/` |

## Conventions

- Map every P0 acceptance criterion to at least one test
- Name tests: `describe('<Unit>')` → `it('should <behavior> when <condition>')`
- Arrange-Act-Assert structure
- Mock external services; use test DB for integration tests

## Coverage targets

- P0 features: 80%+ line coverage on new code
- Critical paths (auth, payments): 90%+

## E2E

- Run against Docker stack (`docker compose --profile dev up`)
- Use Playwright `baseURL` from env
- Prefer `data-testid` for stable selectors
